<!-- loopkit:start -->
## Loop Engineering (LoopKit)
For every non-trivial task, follow `.loop/LOOP.md`: read the spine in `.loop/`, define a measurable goal,
iterate Goal -> Action -> Observe -> Adjust in small verified steps, persist state every iteration,
and finish with the Handoff Report. Never claim a check passed without running it.
Never run production-affecting commands without explicit approval.
<!-- loopkit:end -->
